{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CSMarginCorrelationConstant","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CSMarginCorrelationConstant","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Sqrt","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CSMarginCorrelationConstant.csMargin_rho_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CSMarginCorrelationConstant.csMargin_rho_eq","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CSMarginCorrelationConstant.lean#L48-L70","doc":"**The (CS) correlation is `ρ_P = 2√6/5` (sorry-free).**\n\nOver `ℝ`, with `Â₃ = 8/(5π)`, `V_A = 8/(9π²)` and `π > 0`, the correlation `ρ_P = Â₃/√(3 V_A)`\nequals `2√6/5`. Proved from the rational square (`csMargin_rhoSq_eq`) via `√`-of-square with both\nsides nonnegative. This is the exact RHS of the leading-order margin `m∞ = ρ_P − √(V_D/V_A)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CSMarginCorrelationConstant.csMargin_rhoSq_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CSMarginCorrelationConstant.csMargin_rhoSq_eq","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CSMarginCorrelationConstant.lean#L37-L46","doc":"**The (CS) correlation squared is rational: `Â₃²/(3 V_A) = 24/25` (sorry-free).**\n\nWith the de-poissonized leading constants `Â₃ = 8/(5p)` and `V_A = 8/(9p²)` (`p := π`), the ratio\n`Â₃²/(3 V_A)` is `24/25` — the factors of `p` cancel exactly. Stated over any characteristic-zero\nfield with `p ≠ 0` (§7c: purely algebraic; `CharZero` supplies `5,8,9,25 ≠ 0`). Perturbing either\nconstant breaks the equality, so this is a falsifiable identity. ","signatureChunk":0}]}